  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3202.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3202.01 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to the owner or operator of:\n\n(a) A fossil fuel fired boiler or indirect heat exchanger with a maximum rated heat input capacity of 250 MMBtu/hour, or more, which operated at any time in calendar year 1990; and\n\n(b) A fossil fuel fired combustion device with a rated output of 15 MW, or more, which provides electricity for sale or use.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
}
